.SH CONFIGURATION
The configuration is a plain
.IB key = value
file: comments start with
.BR # ,
and the last occurrence of a key wins.
Edit it by hand, with
.BR "claude settings" ,
or in the dashboard's Settings view.
.SS Settings
.TP 22
.BR ssh_host " (empty)"
Default ssh alias.
.TP
.BR machine " (empty)"
herdr machine label for the default host.
.TP
.BR hosts " (empty)"
Machines shown together, comma\-separated.
Empty means just the default host.
.TP
.BR refresh " (10)"
Seconds between session refreshes in every live view.
.TP
.BR stats " (on)"
Live machine stats in the dashboard:
.BR on ", " selected " or " off .
.TP
.BR stats_interval " (2)"
Seconds between machine stat samples.
.TP
.BR theme " (auto)"
.BR auto ", " dark " or " light .
.B NO_COLOR
turns colour off.
.TP
.BR accent " (#d97757)"
Accent colour.
.TP
.BR mouse " (true)"
Mouse clicks and scrolling in full\-screen views.
.TP
.BR naming " (verb)"
How new sessions are named:
.IR <agent>_<verb> " (" verb ") or " <agent>_<folder> " (" folder ),
e.g.
.I claude_ignite
or
.IR codex_px .
.TP
.BR tab_prefix " (empty)"
Tab name prefix.
Empty means
.IR <agent>_ .
.TP
.BR agent " (claude)"
Default agent for new sessions (an agent id;
.B "claude agents"
lists them).
.BI host. alias .agent
overrides it for one machine.
.TP
.BR agents " (all)"
Whose sessions are listed everywhere:
.BR all ,
or a comma\-separated list of agent ids such as
.BR claude,codex .
.TP
.BR wraps " (claude)"
The agent the shell function stands in for.
Its own flags and subcommands, piped calls and calls inside herdr panes go to
it.
install.sh sets it when
.B \-\-name
shadows an agent's program, or with
.BR \-\-wraps .
.TP
.BR return_to_dashboard " (true)"
Come back to the dashboard after detaching.
.TP
.BR show_hidden " (false)"
Browser: show dot\-folders.
.TP
.BR show_ignored " (false)"
Browser: show package and build folders.
.TP
.BR ignore " (empty)"
Browser ignore\-list edits, for example
.BR +data,\-build .
.TP
.BR browse_ttl " (600)"
Seconds before a cached folder listing is fetched again.
.TP
.BR deep_search " (3)"
Browser: folder levels indexed for search (0 turns it off).
.TP
.BR notify " (true)"
.BR "claude watch" :
notify when a session needs you.
.TP
.BR notify_done " (false)"
.BR "claude watch" :
also notify when a session finishes.
.TP
.BR watch_interval " (20)"
.BR "claude watch" :
seconds between checks.
.TP
.BR ssh_reuse " (0)"
Keep a shared ssh connection open for N seconds (0 turns sharing off).
.TP
.BR wall_layout " (grid)"
Wall layout:
.BR grid ", " main ", " rows " or " cols .
.TP
.BR wall_max " (9)"
Tiles per wall page.
.TP
.BR hook.pre_new " (empty)"
Shell command run in the new pane before the agent starts (remote).
.TP
.BR hook.post_new " (empty)"
Local command run after a session starts, with
.BR CH_HOST ,
.BR CH_DIR ,
.B CH_NAME
and
.B CH_PANE
set.
.TP
.BR update_repo " (empty)"
GitHub
.I owner/repo
that publishes releases, for
.BR self\-update .
.TP
.BR raycast_dirs " (~/.raycast\-scripts)"
Raycast script folders, colon\-separated.
.SS Per\-host, presets and keys
.TP 22
.BI host. alias .color
Machine colour; assigned automatically once.
.TP
.BI host. alias .machine
herdr machine label for that alias, when it differs from the alias.
.TP
.BI host. alias .dir
Folder where the browser and
